  "description": "The proposed works is for a three-storey annexe extension to property number 10. The proposal is built over the existing car parking area, retaining the parking area below. The ground floor of the annex is connected to the existing house through a new internal door. An external door provides access to the parking space and rear garden. A bike store is also proposed at ground floor level with direct access from the outside. The first floor proposes a living room and kitchen, while the second floor proposes a new shower room, WC, bedroom and dressing room.\n\nA previous application was made and approved in 2018. Please note:The current application is higher following the roof line of the existing\nbuilding, but includes the same facilities as the earlier application.\n",
